215
16:21.550 --> 16:22.600
Just like this.

216
16:29.460 --> 16:30.390
Use this.

217
16:31.390 --> 16:32.320
Use this.

218
16:39.740 --> 16:41.500
Be careful.

219
16:57.170 --> 16:58.480
After crossing the grasslands,

220
16:59.910 --> 17:01.220
