232
18:23.390 --> 18:24.670
These are not excuses for indiscipline.

233
18:24.860 --> 18:25.960
Whoever they're assigned to is responsible for them.

234
18:25.990 --> 18:27.230
Take people back to look for them immediately.

235
18:27.940 --> 18:28.620
